WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.325 --> 00:00:10.899
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> This painting is a self-portrait by the

2
00:00:10.899 --> 00:00:13.567
Dutch painter Vincent Van Gogh.

3
00:00:15.431 --> 00:00:18.827
Van Gogh was born in Delft, in the Netherlands,

4
00:00:18.846 --> 00:00:21.910
on the thirtieth of March eighteen fifty-three.

5
00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:26.865
His parents weren’t poor – his father was

6
00:00:26.865 --> 00:00:30.474
a church minister, and his mother was an artist.

7
00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.587
There is only one known photograph of him,

8
00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:38.152
which is when he was nineteen years old.

9
00:00:40.035 --> 00:00:42.638
We only have an idea of what he looked like as

10
00:00:42.638 --> 00:00:45.388
an adult because of his many self-portraits.

11
00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:52.088
He painted thirty-five, all in the last four years of his life.

12
00:00:53.952 --> 00:00:57.552
He painted so many self-portraits because he was very poor,

13
00:00:57.718 --> 00:00:59.822
and it was cheaper than paying models.

14
00:01:02.369 --> 00:01:05.729
In eighteen eighty-eight, when he was thirty-five,

15
00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:09.106
Van Gogh was in Arles, in the south of France.

16
00:01:12.078 --> 00:01:14.238
He was happy there because the light

17
00:01:14.238 --> 00:01:19.877
and the colours were beautiful. His friend, painter Paul Gaugin,

18
00:01:19.987 --> 00:01:22.359
was with him in Arles for a short time.

19
00:01:23.457 --> 00:01:27.407
Van Gogh was not strong mentally, and the relationship between

20
00:01:27.426 --> 00:01:30.047
Van Gogh and Gaugin was difficult.

21
00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:34.698
After a big fight, Van Gogh cut off part of his ear.

22
00:01:36.018 --> 00:01:39.488
He later painted a self-portrait with the injured ear.

23
00:01:41.961 --> 00:01:45.625
After that he was in a psychiatric hospital for some time

24
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:47.157
in the south of France.

25
00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:53.654
This was his last self-portrait. He painted it in September

26
00:01:53.673 --> 00:01:56.617
eighty eighty-nine when he was in the hospital.

27
00:01:58.297 --> 00:02:03.963
In this self-portrait, we see Van Gogh as a painter for the very first time.

28
00:02:06.049 --> 00:02:08.670
Van Gogh died a few months later,

29
00:02:08.855 --> 00:02:11.752
on the twenty-ninth of July eighteen ninety.

30
00:02:12.675 --> 00:02:15.426
He was only thirty-seven years old.

31
00:02:17.493 --> 00:02:20.501
His paintings weren’t popular during his lifetime

32
00:02:20.908 --> 00:02:22.901
and he was never rich or famous.

33
00:02:24.045 --> 00:02:27.368
But today Van Gogh’s pictures are everywhere.

34
00:02:29.214 --> 00:02:32.739
People think that he is one of the greatest painters in the world,

35
00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:38.000
and his paintings, like <i>Sunflowers</i>, and <i>The Starry Night</i>,

36
00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:40.436
sell for millions of pounds.